# Recipe Registry for World of Warcraft: Forever.
#
# Its own addon folder, not a second TOC over the TBC files, because the two
# clients share content and not APIs: Forever is vanilla content behind a
# retail-shaped API. Code that is only correct on one of them has no business
# loading on the other, where it is at best dead and at worst a Lua error.
#
# The file list below is the TBC one, file for file, because this tree starts as
# a copy and diverges from here. What is already known to diverge is in
# docs/forever/scan-rewrite.md.
#
# The Interface number is READ FROM THE CLIENT, not derived: GetBuildInfo() on
# 2026-09-18 answered 1.60.1 / 69913 / Sep 17 2026 / 16001. The
# major*10000 + minor*100 + patch rule happened to predict it, but 16001 is now
# the client's own answer and not an inference. Re-read it when the beta takes a
# build that moves the version, because a stale number only costs an out-of-date
# warning here, not a refusal to load.
## Interface: 16001
## Title: Recipe Registry |cff33ff99(Forever)|r
## Notes: Guild profession tracker for WoW: Forever. Adaptation in progress.
## Author: Kaedros
## Version: 0.1.0-dev
## X-Build-Channel: dev
## X-Build-ID: forever-dev
## SavedVariables: RecipeRegistryDB,RecipeRegistryLogDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: RecipeRegistryCharDB
## X-Category: Guild
## OptionalDeps: TradeSkillMaster,Auctionator

